{"id":"omit_time","text":"Ravi plans to buy a laptop next month. He has compared three models, but he has not placed an order. Has Ravi bought the laptop?","goodWire":"[$.laptop(l1),$.time($.plan(ravi,$.buy(ravi,l1)),next_month),$.model_set(s1),$.compare(ravi,s1),$.cardinality(s1,3),N($.place_order(ravi)),Q($.buy(ravi,l1))]","badWire":"[$.laptop(l1),$.plan(ravi,$.buy(ravi,l1)),$.model_set(s1),$.compare(ravi,s1),$.cardinality(s1,3),N($.place_order(ravi)),Q($.buy(ravi,l1))]","expectedProblem":"missing next month"}
{"id":"lose_modality","text":"Every employee who handles customer data must complete privacy training. Ana is an employee and handles customer data. Has Ana completed the training?","goodWire":"[U(x,I(A($.employee(x),$.handle(x,customer_data)),$.must($.complete(x,privacy_training)))),$.employee(ana),$.handle(ana,customer_data),Q($.complete(ana,privacy_training))]","badWire":"[U(x,I(A($.employee(x),$.handle(x,customer_data)),$.complete(x,privacy_training))),$.employee(ana),$.handle(ana,customer_data),Q($.complete(ana,privacy_training))]","expectedProblem":"must became fact requirement"}
{"id":"attribution_as_fact","text":"Lea told Omar that the server was offline. Omar did not verify the claim. Is the server definitely offline?","goodWire":"[$.tell(lea,omar,$.offline(server)),N($.verify(omar,$.offline(server))),Q($.offline(server))]","badWire":"[$.offline(server),N($.verify(omar,$.offline(server))),Q($.offline(server))]","expectedProblem":"reported claim turned into fact"}
{"id":"unless_flip","text":"The backup runs every night unless maintenance mode is enabled. Maintenance mode was enabled last night. Did the backup run last night?","goodWire":"[U(x,I(N($.maintenance_mode(x)),$.backup_run(x))),$.maintenance_mode(last_night),Q($.backup_run(last_night))]","badWire":"[U(x,I($.maintenance_mode(x),N($.backup_run(x)))),$.maintenance_mode(last_night),Q($.backup_run(last_night))]","expectedProblem":"unless strengthened into prohibition"}
{"id":"only_if_reverse","text":"The application allows a user to download the dataset only if that user is registered. It allowed Niko to download the dataset. Is Niko registered?","goodWire":"[U(x,I($.allow_download(app,x,dataset),$.registered(x))),$.allow_download(app,niko,dataset),Q($.registered(niko))]","badWire":"[U(x,I($.registered(x),$.allow_download(app,x,dataset))),$.allow_download(app,niko,dataset),Q($.registered(niko))]","expectedProblem":"only-if direction reversed"}
{"id":"lose_order","text":"Maria submitted the revised proposal on Monday. Leo forwarded it to Iris on Tuesday, and Iris archived it after reading it. Who archived the proposal?","goodWire":"[$.proposal(p1),$.revised(p1),$.time($.submit(maria,p1),monday),$.time($.forward(leo,p1,iris),tuesday),$.read(iris,p1),$.after($.archive(iris,p1),$.read(iris,p1)),W(x,$.archive(x,p1))]","badWire":"[$.proposal(p1),$.revised(p1),$.submit(maria,p1),$.forward(leo,p1,iris),$.read(iris,p1),$.archive(iris,p1),W(x,$.archive(x,p1))]","expectedProblem":"days and after relation omitted"}
{"id":"negation_scope","text":"Alice did not promise to attend the meeting. Bob thinks she promised not to attend it. Did Alice promise to attend?","goodWire":"[N($.promise(alice,$.attend(alice,meeting1))),$.believe(bob,$.promise(alice,N($.attend(alice,meeting1)))),Q($.promise(alice,$.attend(alice,meeting1)))]","badWire":"[$.promise(alice,N($.attend(alice,meeting1))),$.believe(bob,$.promise(alice,N($.attend(alice,meeting1)))),Q($.promise(alice,$.attend(alice,meeting1)))]","expectedProblem":"not promise changed to promise not"}
{"id":"belief_as_fact","text":"Sam believes the package arrived on Friday. Tracking data shows that it arrived on Saturday. Did the package arrive on Friday?","goodWire":"[$.believe(sam,$.time($.arrive(package1),friday)),$.show(tracking_data,$.time($.arrive(package1),saturday)),Q($.time($.arrive(package1),friday))]","badWire":"[$.time($.arrive(package1),friday),$.show(tracking_data,$.time($.arrive(package1),saturday)),Q($.time($.arrive(package1),friday))]","expectedProblem":"belief promoted to fact"}
{"id":"argument_swap","text":"Jules gave Pat the key because Pat had locked the door. Did Pat give Jules the key?","goodWire":"[$.lock(pat,door1),$.give(jules,key1,pat),$.cause($.lock(pat,door1),$.give(jules,key1,pat)),Q($.give(pat,key1,jules))]","badWire":"[$.lock(pat,door1),$.give(pat,key1,jules),$.cause($.lock(pat,door1),$.give(pat,key1,jules)),Q($.give(pat,key1,jules))]","expectedProblem":"giver and receiver swapped"}
{"id":"converse_error","text":"Each approved expense has a receipt. Expense E3 has a receipt, but its approval status is unknown. Is E3 approved?","goodWire":"[U(x,I($.approved(x),$.has_receipt(x))),$.expense(e3),$.has_receipt(e3),$.unknown($.approved(e3)),Q($.approved(e3))]","badWire":"[U(x,I($.has_receipt(x),$.approved(x))),$.expense(e3),$.has_receipt(e3),$.unknown($.approved(e3)),Q($.approved(e3))]","expectedProblem":"implication direction reversed"}
{"id":"unknown_to_false","text":"If the service is overloaded, latency usually increases. Today latency increased, but we do not know whether the service was overloaded. Was the service definitely overloaded?","goodWire":"[$.usually(I($.overloaded(service),$.increase(latency))),$.time($.increase(latency),today),$.unknown($.overloaded(service)),Q($.overloaded(service))]","badWire":"[$.usually(I($.overloaded(service),$.increase(latency))),$.time($.increase(latency),today),N($.overloaded(service)),Q($.overloaded(service))]","expectedProblem":"unknown replaced by false"}
